IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-core`
IMPORT `sfaa-div4-civil-penalty`

-- Tests for sfaa-div4-civil-penalty.l4 (sections 137ZD to 137ZF). Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion.
-- Section 137ZG (rules of court) is machinery and has no function. There is no regulative rule in this Division, so there is no trace.


§ `s 137ZD(1): when the Authority may bring the action`
-- (a): a listed provision, contravened intentionally or recklessly
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a)(i) section 135` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a)(i) section 137ZA(1) or (2)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a)(ii) section 135, 136, 137, 137A or 137B as applied by section 137J(1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a)(iii) section 135, 136, 137, 137A or 137B as applied by section 137U(1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a listed provision contravened without intent or recklessness: the paragraph does not say that founds no action; NOTHING (split site (i))
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a)(i) section 135` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- a provision the paragraph does not list: the list is not closed by "only", so NOTHING either way
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a) a provision the paragraph does not list` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(a) the person intentionally or recklessly contravened a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(a) a provision the paragraph does not list` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): false or misleading information in purported compliance, known or recklessly so
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(b) the person gave false or misleading information in purported compliance with a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(b)(i) section 137` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(b) the person gave false or misleading information in purported compliance with a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(b)(i) section 137` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(b) the person gave false or misleading information in purported compliance with a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(b)(i) section 137` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(b) the person gave false or misleading information in purported compliance with a provision the paragraph lists` `s 137ZD(1)(b) a provision the paragraph does not list` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c): an officer who intentionally or recklessly commits an act in section 137G(5)(a), (b) or (c) (or its Division 2 and 3 counterparts)
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(c) the officer intentionally or recklessly committed an act referred to in the paragraph` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(c) the officer intentionally or recklessly committed an act referred to in the paragraph` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(c) the officer intentionally or recklessly committed an act referred to in the paragraph` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1)(c) the officer intentionally or recklessly committed an act referred to in the paragraph` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the Authority's power: it appears to the Authority AND the Public Prosecutor consents (split site (ii): a failed gate is NOTHING under the ruling of 2026-11-12)
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1) the Authority may bring an action in a court for an order for a civil penalty` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1) the Authority may bring an action in a court for an order for a civil penalty` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1) the Authority may bring an action in a court for an order for a civil penalty` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1) the Authority may bring an action in a court for an order for a civil penalty` NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(1) the Authority may bring an action in a court for an order for a civil penalty` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 137ZD(2): the order and its limits`
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the court may make an order against the person for the payment of a civil penalty` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the court may make an order against the person for the payment of a civil penalty` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "a sum not less than $50,000 and not more than $2 million"
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 50000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 2000000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 1000000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 49999 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 2000001 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(2) the amount of the civil penalty is within the limits` 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 137ZD(3) and (4): agreed orders`
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(3) the court may make an order on the terms agreed between the Authority and the person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(3) the court may make an order on the terms agreed between the Authority and the person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(3) the court may make an order on the terms agreed between the Authority and the person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4): an agreement for an act in (1)(a), (b) or (c) within the limits of (2)
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(4) nothing in section 137ZD prevents the Authority from entering into the agreement` TRUE 50000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(4) nothing in section 137ZD prevents the Authority from entering into the agreement` TRUE 2000000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(4) nothing in section 137ZD prevents the Authority from entering into the agreement` TRUE 49999 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(4) nothing in section 137ZD prevents the Authority from entering into the agreement` TRUE 2000001 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(4) nothing in section 137ZD prevents the Authority from entering into the agreement` FALSE 100000 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 137ZD(5), (6) and (7): payment, recovery and defences`
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(5) the civil penalty is paid into the Consolidated Fund and is a debt due to the Government` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(5) the civil penalty is paid into the Consolidated Fund and is a debt due to the Government` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(6) the Authority may recover the civil penalty as a judgment debt due to the Authority` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(6) the Authority may recover the civil penalty as a judgment debt due to the Authority` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(7) the defence is also available to the person against whom the action is brought` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(7) the defence is also available to the person against whom the action is brought` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZD(7) the defence is also available to the person against whom the action is brought` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 137ZE(1): when the action must not be commenced`
-- (a): 6 years from the date of the act. An act on 15 March 2020: the last day is 15 March 2026 (sfa-periods P1, P4)
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(a) the action must not be commenced because 6 years from the date of the act have expired` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(a) the action must not be commenced because 6 years from the date of the act have expired` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(a) the action must not be commenced because 6 years from the date of the act have expired` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 1 1 2021) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(a) the action must not be commenced because 6 years from the date of the act have expired` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2020) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): convicted, or acquitted other than by withdrawal of the charge
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(b) the action must not be commenced because the person has been convicted or acquitted` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(b) the action must not be commenced because the person has been convicted or acquitted` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- acquitted because of the withdrawal of the charge: the exception, so the bar does not apply
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(b) the action must not be commenced because the person has been convicted or acquitted` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1)(b) the action must not be commenced because the person has been convicted or acquitted` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the two limbs together
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1) the action must not be commenced` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1) the action must not be commenced` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1) the action must not be commenced` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 16 3 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1) the action must not be commenced` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(1) the action must not be commenced` (Date 15 3 2020) (Date 15 3 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 137ZE(2): stay and continuation`
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the action must be stayed` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no criminal proceedings commenced: "after criminal proceedings have been commenced" limits the stay, so NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the action must be stayed` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "may thereafter be continued only if" (a) discharged, not an acquittal, or (b) the charge withdrawn
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the stayed action may be continued` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the stayed action may be continued` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the stayed action may be continued` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZE(2) the stayed action may be continued` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 137ZF: District Court`
#ASSERT `s 137ZF a District Court has jurisdiction to hear and determine the action regardless of the monetary amount` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 137ZF a District Court has jurisdiction to hear and determine the action regardless of the monetary amount` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
